  "content": [
    {
      "text": "let him reprove me, Ps. 141:5. they despised all my reproof, Prov. 1:30. reproofs of instruction are the way of life, Prov. 6:23. he that refuseth reproof erreth, Prov. 10:17 (12:1). he that regardeth reproof shall be honoured, Prov. 13:18. he that hateth reproof shall die, Prov. 15:10. reproof entereth more into a wise man, Prov. 17:10. reprove one that hath understanding, Prov. 19:25. He, that being often reproved hardeneth his neck, Prov. 29:1. rod and reproof give wisdom, Prov. 29:15. reprove with equity for the meek, Isa. 11:4 (2 Ne. 21:4). thy backslidings shall reprove thee, Jer. 2:19.",
